      {
        "id": "fifo-definition",
        "moduleId": "fifo-positioning",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "FIFO 的队列语义",
        "markdown": "先进先出（First In First Out，FIFO）调度，也称为先到先服务（First Come First Served，FCFS）。它维护一个就绪队列：任务按到达或入队的先后顺序排队，调度器每次选择队首任务运行，直到该任务运行结束或主动放弃 CPU，才轮到下一个任务。FIFO 的突出优点是简单、易于实现；在任务同时到达且运行时间相近的假设下，它的效果很好。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000091"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "先进先出（FIFO）"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2110,
              "lineEnd": 2135,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0001/images/3b454a8e27677a5f671346336e9d911186e73316050cbcf038cd54fb0cc78098.jpg",
                "parts/part-0001/images/3a379f7d28dad8e5632cc9cf810f25ba8ba0b709f96d3fffacdb8bf394c05953.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "3a31c2c62e971d0ed159105c0eeb39f948e13f2dc076ac7670319168293f2c71"
            }
          ]
        }
